sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor OP as Operator
  participant M as Manager
  participant R as run.py
  participant TG as Taskgraph
  participant W as Worker
  participant V as Verifier
  participant H as Code host

  M->>M: config.py check
  M->>R: launch 41
  R->>TG: show 41 (notes, scope, verify)
  R->>W: render brief, claude --bg --worktree task-41
  R->>TG: start 41, meta session, model, attempt
  R-->>M: launched #41 attempt 1
  Note over M: Manager launches other tasks meanwhile
  W->>TG: commit, then result add 41 PASS (Branch, Head, Worktree)
  Note over M: Next drain point
  M->>R: record
  R->>TG: result ls, ls, ready
  R-->>M: arrived #41 attempt 1: PASS
  M->>R: verify 41
  R->>V: claude --bg --worktree verify-41-1, brief pinned to Head SHA
  V->>TG: result add --kind verify, Verdict: test-verified
  M->>R: record
  R-->>M: verified #41 attempt 1: Verdict test-verified
  M->>R: close 41
  R->>TG: meta verdict, verdict_ref, tokens, then done 41
  R->>R: local mode: merge if a MERGE: line allows it, then claude rm
  R->>H: pr mode: push task-41, create request
  R-->>M: closed #41, then merged or ready-to-merge
  M->>R: record
  R->>H: request state, merge when clean
  R-->>M: merged #41, or the request state
  M->>OP: Status report, open decisions, branches ready to merge
